      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DUNDEE SKYE (1) is a promising dog in the frame at five of 20 starts including nine wins and was in the minors again latest (29.99) over 515m at Sandown. Strike rate this course strong having won three of five tries. Looks a key player drawing the cherry. HARRY'S AVENGER (6) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 3.5 lengths into second (23.72) at Bendigo in a Mix 6/7 over 425m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Can feature again. CONCEIVABLE (7) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when eighth (19.72), beaten 4 lengths. Finished third the start before. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Worth following up. ASTON GRANDEUR (2) has strong credentials over this journey.",
